  "notes": "Each size has a pretrained and a dialogue-tuned version (Llama 2-Chat); the chat versions are aliases of the size variants, not separate records. The paper also reports a 34B model that Meta did not release, delaying it for lack of time to red team. Meta said it planned updated fine-tuned models; no separately announced Llama 2 revision was found (the August 2023 updates in the llama repository concern the default system prompt and token sanitisation in the code). The announcement also appears in Meta's Newsroom (about.fb.com/news/2023/07/llama-2/). Llama Guard 7B, in the same Hugging Face collection, is a separate model."
